  "note": "Run twice against `next dev` with ANALYSIS_TAB_ENABLED, TUNING_ENABLED, PROPOSED_CUTS_ENABLED, MANA_BALANCE_ENABLED, PAYMENTS_ENABLED, WELCOME_CREDITS_ENABLED and ABOUT_SHEET_ENABLED 'true', TUNING_V2_STUB_DELAY_MS and TUNING_STUB_DELAY_MS set, a dummy ANTHROPIC_API_KEY and ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL empty (nothing reaches a model): once with SUGGESTED_CHANGES_V2_ENABLED=true, once with it unset, copying `contact-sheets/sc-v2-closeout-part1` aside between runs. A v2-off pass is expected to fail the three intake rows (no v2 intake); it presses nothing. Seeded on a scratch branch of local-dev (the audit account, user_3HdjdocERCjunk0zJQFDWyHkTd4): SCV2_HIST_DECK (HD - Elves d9345373…) holds, newest first, an N=3 spent run (last, so Intake D at N=3 fires), an N=11 run set to charged by a $2.00 cap (units 2, three overCap drops), an N=3 spent run, an N=10 run set to charged by sets (offSet) and an N=10 run refunded short; SCV2_REFUND_DECK (HD - Brago d3f9ccb4…) one N=11 staged-stub run refunded short (units 2, last, so Intake D at N=11 fires); SCV2_FRESH_DECK (HD Tune - Blood Rites cb877695…) no runs. Credits: the free allowance (1) spent in the window, and a welcome lot of 15 with 14 spent, so 1 credit is left and an N=11 press is refused with the 2-credit line. The runs came from the staged stub (TUNING_V2_STUB_DELAY_MS), never a model. About's credits entry (payments off) is `sc-v2-closeout-part1-nopay.json`.",
